<div>
  <dt class='font-semibold text-fg-bright'>Survey Records</dt>
  <dd class='mt-1 text-fg'>
    Free-text notes visible to players and the referee, written in Markdown
    (<%= link_to 'Markdown guide', 'https://www.markdownguide.org/basic-syntax/', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', class: 'text-highlight-fg no-underline hover:underline' %>).
    Shown on the record in a collapsible block; toggle it with the chevron button.
    Reads &ldquo;No findings reported&rdquo; when empty.
  </dd>
</div>
<div>
  <dt class='font-semibold text-fg-bright'>Classified Records</dt>
  <dd class='mt-1 text-fg'>
    Referee-only notes, also written in Markdown. Players never see this block, and it is left out of the API and exports for them.
  </dd>
</div>
